         class=\"wp-block-designsetgo-section alignfull dsgo-stack has-dsgo-animation dsgo-animation-fadeInLeft\"\n          style=\"padding-top:0;padding-right:0;padding-bottom:0;padding-left:0\"\n          data-dsgo-animation-enabled=\"true\"\n          data-dsgo-entrance-animation=\"fadeInLeft\"\n        >\n          <div\n            class=\"dsgo-stack__inner\"\n            style=\"max-width:var(--wp--style--global--content-size, 1140px);margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\"\n          >\n            \n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":6} -->\n<h6 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ingredient Basics</h6>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n            \n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--20)\">Understanding These Ingredients</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n            \n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Kojic Acid and Alpha Arbutin are cosmetic ingredients that can fit into a consistent, gentle routine for people who want to care for the appearance of uneven-looking skin.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n            \n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>Kojic Acid</strong> is commonly used in cosmetic formulas focused on the appearance of uneven-looking skin. <strong>Alpha Arbutin</strong> is a water-soluble cosmetic ingredient often included in complexion-focused routines. Follow product directions, use sun protection, and pay attention to how your skin feels.</p>\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For verified Youth Face Beauty Cream ingredient information, see <a href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/youth-face-cream-ingredients/\">Youth Face Cream Ingredients</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n            \n\n          </div>\n        </div>\n<!-- /wp:designsetgo/section -->\n        \n\n      </div>\n    </div>\n<!-- /wp:designsetgo/grid -->\n  </div>\n  <div\n    class=\"dsgo-shape-divider dsgo-shape-divider--bottom is-shape-inherit is-flip-y\"\n    aria-hidden=\"true\"\n  ></di