Qs\n    </h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n    \n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center\"><strong>What are Kojic Acid and Alpha Arbutin?</strong><br>They are cosmetic ingredients commonly included in complexion-focused skincare routines.<br><br><strong>How should I introduce a new product?</strong><br>Follow the product directions, introduce one new product at a time, and keep the rest of your routine simple.<br><br><strong>What should I do if my skin feels uncomfortable?</strong><br>Stop use if irritation occurs and seek advice from a qualified healthcare professional if you have concerns.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n    \n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n      \n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-primary\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-primary\">\n        <a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https://youthfacebeauty.com/youth-face-beauty-cream/\"\n          >Explore Youth Face Beauty Cream 25g</a\n        >\n      </div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n    </div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n  </div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"dsgo-shape-divider dsgo-shape-divider--bottom is-shape-inherit is-flip-y\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:designsetgo/section -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"max-width:720px;margin:28px auto;padding:18px 20px;border:1px solid #e5e0d8;border-radius:12px;background:#faf6f2;text-align:center;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a1a;\">More Youth Face guides</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.92em;line-height:1.8;color:#444;\"><a href=\"/kojic-acid-and-alpha-arbutin-benefits-how-to-use-skincare-guide/\" style=\"color:#1a5c33;\">Understanding kojic acid and alpha arbutin</a> &middot; <a href=\"/kojic-acid-for-dark-spots-how-it-works-how-to-use-it-what-to-know/\" style=\"color:#1a5c33;\">Kojic acid for dark spots: how it works</a> &middot; <a 